 burned. Nothing waits in a wallet: every claim is deposited within a minute.\n🌊 WHAT IF YOUR TOKEN HASN’T BONDED YET?\nLiquidity doesn’t have to wait for bonding.\n\nBefore bonding, every fee your token generates is a buyback and burn:\n\n• 90% buys back and burns your token.\n• 10% is burned in $LIQUIFY.\n\nOnce your token bonds, the mechanism shifts to building its PumpSwap liquidity pool.\n\nEvery trade contributes. Every fee has a purpose. Every action is a public transaction you can verify on the Engine page.","icon":"lEGYEkFUbZnAhjAk","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/WlvhJWfRjHjg9ACz?width=900&height=300&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/solana/AEqqTu9iYMvzWJa8Ub9XtQaN1awYw3uyUEPJxVe9pump?timestamp=1792155600000","links":[{"url":"https://liquify.trade/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/liquifytrade"}],"totalAmount":100},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/robinhood/0xca0c66ba9979c66477bb5c61aa0d91a5e8ca31be","chainId":"robinhood","tokenAddress":"0xCA0c66Ba9979c66477bB5c61aA0D91A5e8CA31BE","description":"From Normie to Jeet. They said trust the process. Jeetie sold the process and bought a penthouse.","icon":"2dR1CHjZ_Wtvy1SO","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/n_tnsNXpMRr5ARDr?width=900&height=300&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/robinhood/0xca0c66ba9979c66477bb5c61aa0d91a5e8ca31be?timestamp=1792155600000","links":[{"url":"https://jeet.enterprises/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/JeetOnYou"},{"type":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/JeetOnYou"}],"totalAmount":100},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/solana/tth5rjwvxcfbdjd3x2anbxtydjtrcfa9ty4qpmupump","chainId":"solana","tokenAddress":"ttH5rJWVxCFBdjd3x2AnBxtYDJtRCFa9ty4QpmUpump","description":"$ROULANA is the coin of Roulana: live multiplayer European roulette on Solana, played with real USDC at one 3D table. Every round with money on it is drawn and paid by a Sol